arch 2022](https://www.aph.gov.au/Parliamentary_Business/Committees/Senate/Community_Affairs/WorkforceIncentiveBill)\".*","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-7596","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2022-02-10/2"}
